{
  "title": "6th Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \r\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لاَ تَخْذُلْنِیْ فِیْهِ لِتَعَرُّضِ مَعْصِیَتِكَ وَ لاَ تَضْرِبْنِیْ بِسِیَاطِ نِقْمَتِكَ وَ زَحْزِحْنِیْ فِیْهِ مِنْ مُوْجِبَاتِ سَخَطِكَ بِمَنِّكَ وَاٰیَادِیْكَ یَامُنْتَهٰی رَغَبَۃِ الرَّاغِبِیْنَ.\r\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\r\nALLAAHUMMA LAA TAKHZULNEE FEEHE LE-TA-A’RROZE MA’SEYATEKA WA LAA TAZRIBNEE BE-SEYAATE NAQEMATEKA WA ZAHZEHNEE FEEHE MIN MOOJEBAATE SAKHATEKA BEMANNEKA WA AYAADEEKA YAA MUNTAHAA RAGHBATIR RAAGHEBEENA.\r\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\r\nO Allah! Do not leave me free in this month to face the sins. Do not lash me with the lash of Your punishment. Keep me away in this month from such deeds that may influence Your anger, necessarily. I appeal to Your kindness and Blessings, O the last limit for the craving (creatures)!"
}
